{
  "final_message": "**Status:** Reproduced, on a9269c6 (3.5.17) and on the published 3.5.14 and 3.5.17 builds. Published 3.5.13 renders correctly.\n\n- **Expected:** `SubComponent` shows the content the parent passes for `#_duration`, the same as it does for `#title`.\n- **Actual:** `<div><p>conditional</p><span>provided title</span><span>default _duration</span></div>`. The `#title` content renders, but `#_duration` shows its fallback content.\n- **Trigger:** This is the reporter's playground, rewritten as runtime-compiled components:\n  - a slot whose name starts with `_` is passed to `SubComponent`;\n  - `SubComponent` sits in `BaseLayout`'s default slot, next to a `<template v-if ... #randomslotname>`.\n  - Without the `v-if` sibling slot, it works (that's the control test, which passes).\n- **Run:** `npx vitest run packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts`\n  - The control test passes.\n  - The reporter's case fails with the output above.\n- **Reliability:** Fails every run (it's deterministic).\n- **Artifacts:** a single new test file, `packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts`. No production code was changed.\n\n**Likely cause:** In `assignSlots` in `packages/runtime-core/src/componentSlots.ts`, the guard on the non-optimized path changed between 3.5.13 and 3.5.14:\n- 3.5.13: `key !== '_'`\n- 3.5.14: `!isInternalKey(key)`\n\n`isInternalKey` is `key[0] === '_' || key === '$stable'`, so a user slot named `_duration` gets dropped as if it were internal. The guard probably changed to skip the new `__` cache-index marker (that marker was added in #13215, which touched this file in the same release). The `v-if` sibling slot matters because it makes the slot render through the non-optimized path. As a check, I temporarily put the guard back to `key !== '_'` and both tests passed; I then reverted that change.",
  "patch": "diff --git a/packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts b/packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..5932e80\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts\n@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+import { createApp } from '../src'\n+\n+// Reproduction for: slot <template> not rendered when its name starts with \"_\"\n+// (since v3.5.14). Mirrors the reporter's playground App/BaseLayout/SubComponent.\n+describe('slot whose name starts with an underscore', () => {\n+  const BaseLayout = {\n+    template: `<div><slot name=\"randomslotname\"></slot><slot></slot></div>`,\n+  }\n+  const SubComponent = {\n+    template: `\n+      <slot name=\"title\"><span>default title</span></slot>\n+      <slot name=\"_duration\"><span>default _duration</span></slot>\n+    `,\n+  }\n+\n+  const mount = (template: string) => {\n+    const container = document.createElement('div')\n+    createApp({\n+      components: { BaseLayout, SubComponent },\n+      data: () => ({ anyConditionCheckHereWillDo: true }),\n+      template,\n+    }).mount(container)\n+    return container.innerHTML\n+  }\n+\n+  const subComponentUsage = `\n+    <SubComponent>\n+      <template #title><span>provided title</span></template>\n+      <template #_duration><span>provided _duration</span></template>\n+    </SubComponent>`\n+\n+  // control: no conditional sibling slot -> works\n+  it('renders provided _duration slot (no v-if sibling slot)', () => {\n+    const html = mount(`<BaseLayout>${subComponentUsage}</BaseLayout>`)\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided title')\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided _duration')\n+  })\n+\n+  // reporter's case: sibling conditional slot on the parent component\n+  it('renders provided _duration slot when sibling of v-if slot', () => {\n+    const html = mount(`\n+      <BaseLayout>\n+        <template v-if=\"anyConditionCheckHereWillDo\" #randomslotname>\n+          <p>conditional</p>\n+        </template>\n+        ${subComponentUsage}\n+      </BaseLayout>`)\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided title')\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided _duration')\n+    expect(html).not.toContain('default _duration')\n+  })\n+})\n",
  "run_command": "npx vitest run packages/vue/__tests__/slotUnderscoreName.spec.ts"
}